.TH AD-DECORATE 1 "2026-08-20" "ad_vim 2.0" "ad_vim pipeline"
.SH NAME
ad_layer_highlight \- insert decoration ops into the timed op stream
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ad_layer_highlight
[\fIoptions\fR] < \fItimed_ops\fR > \fIdecorated_ops\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ad_layer_highlight
is stage 4 of the ad_vim pipeline. It reads a timed op stream from
stdin and inserts decoration ops (highlight, dim, fold, sign, marker)
based on the options. Both the vimscript animator and the C animator
interpret the decoration ops the same way.

The pipeline is: compute \[->] postprocess \[->] pace \[->]
.B decorate
\[->] animator
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-highlight \ \fInone|inline|word|hunk\fR
Highlight mode (default: none).
.RS
.TP
none
No highlighting
.TP
inline
Highlight each changed char (DiffAdd for insert, DiffDelete for delete)
.TP
word
Highlight the word containing the changed char
.TP
hunk
Highlight the entire hunk region (DiffChange)
.RE
.TP
.BI \-\-highlight-duration-ms \ N
Highlight duration in milliseconds (default: 200)
.TP
.B \-\-dim-unchanged
Dim unchanged anchor lines to draw attention to changes
.TP
.BI \-\-dim-unchanged-pct \ N
Dimming percentage 0-100 (default: 60)
.TP
.BI \-\-context \ N
Fold unchanged regions >2N lines, keeping N context lines around each hunk
.TP
.B \-\-fold-unchanged
Fold all unchanged regions between hunks
.TP
.B \-\-sign-column
Place +/- signs in the sign column for changed lines
.TP
.B \-\-git-blame
Insert blame markers (requires git repository)
.TP
.BI \-\-max-hunk-chars \ N
Skip animation for hunks with >N changed chars (emit skip_hunk op)
.TP
.BR \-\-theme \ \fIdark|light|high-contrast\fR
Color theme for highlight groups
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help and exit
.SH "OP TYPES"
.B New op types emitted by decorate:
.TP
.BI highlight \t <sl> \t <sc> \t <el> \t <ec> \t <type> \t <dur>
Highlight a region. Type: insert|delete|hunk. Renderer highlights, waits dur ms, clears.
.TP
.BI dim \t <sl> \t <el> \t <pct>
Dim the specified line range.
.TP
.BI fold \t <sl> \t <el>
Fold the specified line range.
.TP
.BI sign \t <line> \t <type>
Place a sign. Type: add|del.
.TP
.BI marker \t <line> \t <col> \t <text>
Show text at the given position (e.g., git blame).
.TP
.B skip_hunk
Signal the renderer to apply the hunk instantly without animation.
